HST Office: Writer's Phần mở rộng tab fits its room.

- The eight content control icons of the Điều khiển group become one drop-down, "Điều khiển nội dung"
  (Content Controls): the icons came to about 950 px even at the smallest size, so the group always
  folded. The drop-down's items take their labels from their commands.
- The Mẫu group's button gets the label "Mẫu tài liệu" (Document Template): .uno:TemplateManager has no
  icon in the theme, so the group showed empty.
- sw notebookbar.ui and its vi translation; solenv swriter.suppr: the menu items take their accessible
  names from their commands, and the removed icon buttons lose their lines.

License: these upstream files remain under their original license (MPL-2.0).
